    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Roll-up of the Reverse Proxy & Entra ID Health dashboard: number of failing proxy-tier checks (nginx ports, backend proxy reachability, oauth2-proxy, Redis, nginx exporters, failed units, host scrapes). Backend app outages are shown under Web Services Up instead. 0 = Healthy.",
